  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This package supports both Maui apps and native apps.\n\n\t\t\tSample use and documentation:\n\t\t\thttps://github.com/vapolia/Svg-Samples\n\n\t\t\tThis library has no dependency on SkiaSharp, and uses only hardware accelerated low level platform calls.\n\t\t\tIt is fast, small, and reliable.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tIt does not support SVG masks: make sure you save your SVGs as optimized (see documentation on github) so masks are transformed into simple paths.\n\t\t\tIt does not support text rendering, nor non-vector bitmaps.\n\n\t\t\tCommercial support is available at https://vapolia.eu\n\n\t\t\t,----,\n\t\t\t,/   .`|\n\t\t\t,`   .'  :  ,---,                                  ,-.\n\t\t\t;    ;     /,--.' |                              ,--/ /|                 ,---,\n\t\t\t.'___,/    ,' |  |  :                      ,---, ,--. :/ |                /_ ./|   ,---.           ,--,\n\t\t\t|    :     |  :  :  :                  ,-+-. /  |:  : ' /           ,---, |  ' :  '   ,'\\        ,'_ /|\n\t\t\t;    |.';  ;  :  |  |,--.  ,--.--.    ,--.'|'   ||  '  /           /___/ \\.  : | /   /   |  .--. |  | :\n\t\t\t`----'  |  |  |  :  '   | /       \\  |   |  ,\"' |'  |  :            .  \\  \\ ,' '.   ; ,. :,'_ /| :  . |\n\t\t\t'   :  ;  |  |   /' :.--.  .-. | |   | /  | ||  |   \\            \\  ;  `  ,''   | |: :|  ' | |  . .\n\t\t\t|   |  '  '  :  | | | \\__\\/: . . |   | |  | |'  : |. \\            \\  \\    ' '   | .; :|  | ' |  | |\n\t\t\t'   :  |  |  |  ' | : ,\" .--.; | |   | |  |/ |  | ' \\ \\            '  \\   | |   :    |:  | : ;  ; |\n\t\t\t;   |.'   |  :  :_:,'/  /  ,.  | |   | |--'  '  : |--'              \\  ;  ;  \\   \\  / '  :  `--'   \\\n\t\t\t'---'     |  | ,'   ;  :   .'   \\|   |/      ;  |,'                  :  \\  \\  `----'  :  ,      .-./\n\t\t\t`--''     |  ,     .-./'---'       '--'                     \\  ' ;           `--`----'\n\t\t\t`--`---'                                          `--`\n\n\t\t\t1.1.0\n\t\t\tHotfix: ios svg stops intercepting tap gestures when no command/clicked handler is set \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.9\n\t\t\tHotfix: android may crash when the handler is disconnected.\n\t\t\t\n            1.0.8\n            This release focus on getting a stable, fully featured Windows version. Also add support for net 10 and increase performance by caching, especially on iOS.\n            Changes:\n            - DisconnectHandler was explicitely called on Unload, this is not necessary with net9+ and triggers issues on Windows. Removed.\n            - new property RenderRect: the rendered coordinates of the svg in the Svg view. If the ratio of the svg is fixed, the svg won't fill the whole space in the Svg view. This property tells you where the svg is rendered.\n\t\t\t- caching is enabled by default on both platforms\n            \n            Windows support:\n            - all gradients are supported\n            - SvgImageSource is supported with the Windows SVG engine, not the built-in one. This is a limitation in WinUI3.\n            - Performance has been boosted by using a Canvas instead of a ContentControl / Grid.\n            \n            Known issues on Windows:\n            - SvgImageSource does not support ColorMapping, because of a limitation in WinUI3.\n            \n\t\t\t1.0.7\n\t\t\tA gradient referenced with: url(\"#id\") (with double quotes) is now correctly applied on all platforms.\n\t\t\tiOS is now drawing gradients in strokes. They were missing.\n\t\t\tiOS now correctly draws the stroke, even if a gradient was set previously in fill, and fill is explicitly set to none.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.6\n\t\t\tnet9 only. Use 1.0.5 for net8 support.\n\t\t\tupdate nugets\n\t\t\tlinecaps are now correct on all platforms, they were mixed up\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.5\n\t\t\tupdate nugets\n\t\t\tMinimum android version is now API 23 (was API 21)\n\n\t\t\t1.0.4\n\t\t\tmaui: fix crash when infinite space is available. fix invisible crash on android when used in tab's icons.\n\t\t\tBreaking change: FillMode is renamed Aspect to align with maui names and make the discovery of that property easier\n\t\t\tBreaking change: measurement was reworked on maui so it now obeys more intuitively to HorizontalAligment, VerticalAligment and Aspect\n\t\t\tUpdate maui version\n\t\t\tRemove dependency on Maui Compatibility\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.2\n\t\t\tFix crash on Android when the handler is disconnected\n\n\t\t\t1.0.1\n\t\t\tInitial Maui release.\n\t\t\tSee the Vapolia.Xamarin.Svg.Forms and Vapolia.Xamarin.Svg packages for the legacy Xamarin versions.",
